# Frontend Environment Variables Template
# AI-Powered Project & Task Management Platform

# Backend API URL:
# - Leave blank for local development to use the Vite proxy (/api -> http://localhost:8000)
# - In production (e.g. Vercel / Netlify), set to your backend URL:
#   Example: https://ai-task-platform-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=
